The score-generation and radix-selection kernels in cute_score.py,
cute_score_generic.py, paged_score_warpdrive.py and cute_topk.py adapt cuDNN
Frontend source at commit 1ab7d63be81f1ef2eb3b2dea5367219cf9674a5f. Attention
Gym changes their interfaces, workspace layout, scheduling and outputs; they do
not depend on the cuDNN Frontend package. The applicable license is in
LICENSE.Apache-2.0.

cute_score_mxfp8.py and paged_score_mxfp8.py adapt the same score pipeline and
the scale-copy partition from CUTLASS's dense_blockscaled_gemm_persistent.py example
for dense and paged MXFP8 scoring. The BSD-3-Clause terms for that partition are
reproduced in each file.

